WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,438
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,588 --> 00:00:06,341
This is Episode 40.

3
00:00:06,491 --> 00:00:08,614
Remy is visiting today.

4
00:00:08,764 --> 00:00:11,995
He wants to put a box inside Sammy.

5
00:00:12,145 --> 00:00:13,991
But Sammy is locked.

6
00:00:14,141 --> 00:00:14,941
Oh no!

7
00:00:15,091 --> 00:00:18,044
Maya could give Remy a name tag.

8
00:00:18,194 --> 00:00:20,871
But a name tag lasts forever.

9
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:23,882
Remy is only here until sunset.

10
00:00:24,032 --> 00:00:27,724
So Maya gives him a sunset pass instead.

11
00:00:27,874 --> 00:00:29,443
She sticks it on.

12
00:00:29,593 --> 00:00:30,393
Click!

13
00:00:30,543 --> 00:00:31,650
Sammy opens.

14
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,107
Remy puts his box inside.

15
00:00:34,257 --> 00:00:35,919
The sun goes down.

16
00:00:36,069 --> 00:00:38,745
The pass peels off by itself.

17
00:00:38,895 --> 00:00:40,280
It floats away.

18
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:42,091
Sammy locks again.

19
00:00:42,241 --> 00:00:44,733
Nobody had to take it back.

20
00:00:44,883 --> 00:00:47,467
The badge is who you become.

21
00:00:47,617 --> 00:00:50,386
The pass is how long it lasts.

22
00:00:50,536 --> 00:00:52,751
That is the sunset pass.

23
00:00:52,901 --> 00:00:54,470
Now you know STS!

24
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

